From d49e8f12b7ad7b62272731edd4fd8975cda9cc2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:51:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kernel): retry machining meshes at a finer chord

Retry once after a finite deviation refusal, without changing the requested
tolerance or the mesh acceptance checks. Pin the Solidcraft sample at the
app chord and retain refusal when one finer plan is insufficient.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1463
